{"code":"BL14","wikidata":"Q1039683","wikipedia":{"en":"Sam Yan MRT station","th":"สถานีสามย่าน"},"summary":{"en":"Sam Yan station is a Bangkok MRT rapid transit station on the Blue Line. The station is located under Rama IV Road near Sam Yan intersection. Chamchuri Square, Chulalongkorn University, Samyan Mitrtown and Wat Hua Lamphong are located next to the station.","th":"สถานีสามย่าน เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้าใต้ดิน ในเส้นทางรถไฟฟ้ามหานคร สายเฉลิมรัชมงคล ที่ถนนพระรามที่ 4 กรุงเทพมหานคร บริเวณสี่แยกสามย่าน มีทำเลอยู่ใจกลางเมือง ใกล้จุฬาลงกรณ์มหาวิทยาลัย และย่านธุรกิจบริเวณสามย่าน, สี่พระยา และสุรวงศ์"},"opened":"2004-07-03","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8a/MRT_samyan.jpg/960px-MRT_samyan.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:MRT_samyan.jpg","author":"BunBn","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/75/201701_Concourse_of_Sam_Yan_Station.jpg/960px-201701_Concourse_of_Sam_Yan_Station.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:201701_Concourse_of_Sam_Yan_Station.jpg","author":"MNXANL","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ad/201701_Exit_1_of_Sam_Yan_Station.jpg/960px-201701_Exit_1_of_Sam_Yan_Station.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:201701_Exit_1_of_Sam_Yan_Station.jpg","author":"MNXANL","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/64/201701_Exit_2_of_Sam_Yan_Station.jpg/960px-201701_Exit_2_of_Sam_Yan_Station.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:201701_Exit_2_of_Sam_Yan_Station.jpg","author":"MNXANL","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}